@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
    Layout = "_AuthLayout";
}
<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>SecureGate stores employee account details, authenticator enrollment status, and authentication activity so DavaoTech Solutions can investigate unauthorized access.</p>
<p>Passwords and recovery codes are stored only as protected hashes. Authenticator secrets are encrypted. Sign-in pages do not say whether an email address is registered.</p>
<p>Audit records are kept for at least one year and are not edited or deleted through the application.</p>
<p><a asp-page="/Account/Login">Sign in</a></p>
